cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PlateWise 3D in teaching or research, cite this software record."
type: software
title: "PlateWise 3D: Non-Starchy Whole Food Picker"
abstract: >-
  A static, interactive 3D plate builder for exploring non-starchy whole foods,
  net carbohydrates, fiber, glycemic load and an illustrative post-meal glucose
  curve. Educational only; not a medical device.
authors:
